# Third-party notices

This file lists third-party components incorporated into or distributed with
this project.

## Git dependencies

Nothing from another project is vendored into this repository. The driver links
these crates from NVIDIA/OpenShell (https://github.com/NVIDIA/OpenShell) as git
dependencies, pinned to one release tag in the workspace `Cargo.toml`
(currently `v0.1.2`; `Cargo.lock` records the exact commit):

- `openshell-driver-kubernetes`
- `openshell-core`
- `openshell-otel`

License: Apache-2.0. Their transitive crates come from the same repository at
that tag and are recorded in `Cargo.lock` with the rest.

## Generated at release time

The set of transitive Rust dependencies is captured by `Cargo.lock`. A
machine-generated dependency manifest is produced at release time and
attached to each tagged release.
